2026-11-20  Vega Strike Contributors  <maintainers@vega-strike.org>

	* (Release 0.1.2)
	Patch release fixing Windows NSIS installer packaging and version formatting:
	- Removed invalid NSIS icon definitions from CMakeLists.txt to avoid makensis crash.
	- Stripped leading "v" prefix from TAG_NAME for standard SemVer package naming.
	- Corrected path delimiter escaping in Windows shortcut creation parameters.
	- Added robust error handling and NSISOutput.log failure logging in CI.


2026-11-20  Vega Strike Contributors  <maintainers@vega-strike.org>

	* (Release 0.1.1)
	Patch release fixing Windows NSIS installer packaging:
	- Corrected CPACK_NSIS_MUI_ICON and CPACK_NSIS_MUI_UNIICON variables in CMakeLists.txt.
	- Corrected Windows desktop shortcut path to VegaStrike-0.11.
	- Added NSISOutput.log diagnostic logging in script/package.ps1.


2026-11-20  Vega Strike Contributors  <maintainers@vega-strike.org>

	* (Release 0.1.0)
	Formal 0.1.0 release modernizing Black Paralysis for Vega Strike
	Engine 0.11.x (Assets API Version 3):
	- Migrated build and packaging system from Autotools to modern CMake 3.22+ and CPack.
	- Replaced legacy vegastrike.config and CSV manifests with modern JSON format.
	- Expanded universe to 3 interconnected star systems (Isaac, Calion, Nan)
	  forming a complete circular navigation and jump loop.
	- Added multiple base destinations: planetary spaceports, commercial centers,
	  and mined asteroid installations.
	- Restored flyable ship roster (Llama, Plowshare, Schroedinger, Hyena, Lancelot)
	  along with base ship dealership inventories and upgrade paths.
	- Standardized image assets to native PNG and JPG formats and unwrapped all DDS files.
	- Restored authentic historical design lore (PLANNING.md), artwork masters, and Blender tools.
	- Introduced automated test suites for JSON/XML syntax and asset cross-reference integrity
	  integrated with GitHub Actions CI.
	- Upgraded licensing to GNU General Public License Version 3 or later (GPLv3+).


